1. OUTLINE_SHARED_REQUIREMENT_MISSING | 文件=outline/outline.json | Outline omits requirement id "REQ-1".
2. OUTLINE_SHARED_REQUIREMENT_WRITABLE_MISSING | 文件=outline/outline.json | Mandatory requirement "REQ-1" needs a writable section.
